    "body": "<h2 id=\"h_01HKWDMDFERW9PQQF19GA63QB5\">You will learn</h2>\n<p>Learn how to change the email address and password for your account.</p>\n<div class=\"bs-callout bs-callout-default\">\n<p>This article only applies to those who are already logged in. If you are unable to log in to your account, see <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/7872914223899\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">How to reset your Klaviyo password</a>.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HKWDMDFEA16768496QX092KX\">Change your account's email or password</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Click your organization name in the bottom left corner.</li>\n<li>Select <strong>Settings</strong>.</li>\n<li>Under the <em>Account</em> tab, select <strong>Personal</strong>.</li>\n<li>Follow the steps depending on if you want to change your email or password:\n<ul>\n<li>Email\n<ol>\n<li>Under <em>Login email</em>, add your updated email address.</li>\n<li>Verify that this information is correct.</li>\n<li>Select <strong>Save</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>Password\n<ol>\n<li>Under <em>Login password</em>, input your current password.</li>\n<li>Add you updated password under <em>New Password</em>.</li>\n<li>Re-enter your new password to verify it.</li>\n<li>Select <strong>Save</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JAQXC0R8KBXAMABGQ13P9DFJ\">Logging in and out of your account</h2>\n<p>If you have multiple Klaviyo accounts that are not linked to the same email address, you must log out and then log back in to switch between accounts.</p>\n<p>To log out:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Select your organization name in the bottom left corner.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Log out</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>To log in:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Navigate to Klaviyo.com</li>\n<li>In the top right corner, select <strong>Log in</strong>.</li>\n<li>Enter the email address and password associated with your account.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Log in</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Alternatively, you can <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360002165611\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">create a multi-account</a>, which allows you to link multiple Klaviyo accounts to a single email address and password, so you can log in once to access and easily switch between accounts.</p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01HKWDMDFF45W7YMYMDBHJ6D04\">Additional resources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/7872914223899\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">How to reset a Klaviyo password</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/360002165611\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Understand multi-account user privileges</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005232048\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">How to update your credit card information </a></li>\n</ul>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
